# Compiled JS/maps emitted into src/ by tsc (should not be committed)
packages/**/src/**/*.js
packages/**/src/**/*.js.map

# Real Word-generated SmartArt exports and their extracted parts (docs/adr/0004,
# "Round 2-4"): contain verbatim Microsoft algorithm/style XML (layout1.xml,
# colors1.xml, quickStyle1.xml, drawing1.xml) from the maintainer's own Word
# installation. Kept as local research reference only, deliberately never
# committed to this CC0 public repo pending a licensing decision (maintainer
# chose to reimplement an original layoutDef instead of redistributing these,
# 2026-09-03) — see spike.md's "Round 4" for the reasoning.
docs/adr/spikes/spike-smartart/real-diagram1/
docs/adr/spikes/spike-smartart/real-diagram-deep/
docs/adr/spikes/spike-smartart/real-diagram-flat/
docs/adr/spikes/spike-smartart/*Hierarchie*.docx
docs/adr/spikes/spike-smartart/*hierarchie*.docx
docs/adr/spikes/spike-smartart/*niveaux*.docx
docs/adr/spikes/spike-smartart/*enfants*.docx
# hand-data-v4-real-nodrawing.xml is the real data1.xml verbatim (only its
# extLst stripped) — not "hand" content despite the filename.
docs/adr/spikes/spike-smartart/hand-data-v4-real-nodrawing.xml
# v2/v3/v4/v5 build OUTPUTS all graft real-diagram1/'s real layout1.xml (v2
# also colors1/quickStyle1/drawing1) onto base.docx, so the produced .docx/
# .pdf/.png embed real Microsoft content even where the *script* and the
# *hand-authored data* going in are self-written. The build-spike-v*.mjs
# scripts themselves are fine to keep (pure logic, no embedded content) —
# only their outputs are excluded. v1 (spike.docx, diagram-*.xml,
# build-spike.mjs) predates any real Word sample and is fully self-authored,
# so it stays committable.
docs/adr/spikes/spike-smartart/spike-v2.*
docs/adr/spikes/spike-smartart/spike-v3.*
docs/adr/spikes/spike-smartart/spike-v4.*
docs/adr/spikes/spike-smartart/spike-v5.*
# custom-chain1-realstyle.* and custom-chain1-ownercolors.* (Round 5) still
# embed the real quickStyle1.xml (and, for -realstyle, also real colors1.xml)
# borrowed from real-diagram1/ -- everything else under custom-chain1-*/
# custom-tree1.* is fully self-authored (own layout + own data + own
# colorsDef) and stays committable.
docs/adr/spikes/spike-smartart/custom-chain1-realstyle.*
docs/adr/spikes/spike-smartart/custom-chain1-ownercolors.*
# custom-tree1-styled.* embeds the real quickStyle1.xml (own layout/data/colors,
# borrowed quickStyle -- the tree geometry test predates the self-authored
# styleDef confirmation done for chain1).
docs/adr/spikes/spike-smartart/custom-tree1-styled.*
